// An array as a value, logical, bool, float targets: `y = a && c`. KIELER runs it: y is false, true, true.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do y = a && c go to A }
